{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2164","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H. PalindromePalindrome"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We define the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"humor value"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of a string $$$t$$$ as the length of the longest palindrome string which occurs at least twice in it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Formally, a string $$$p$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"humor with respect to $$$t$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", if and only if both of the following conditions are met:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$p$$$ is a palindrome, and "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" there exist "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at least two different"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" indices $$$i \\in [1, |t| - |p| + 1]$$$, such that $$$t[i, i + |p| - 1] = p$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"humor value"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of $$$t$$$ is defined as the maximum length among all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"humor"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" strings "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"with respect to $$$t$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ which only contains lowercase Latin letters and $$$q$$$ queries. Each query contains two integers $$$l_i$$$, $$$r_i$$$, and you need to find the humor value of the string $$$s[l_i, r_i]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here, $$$a[l, r]$$$ is defined as the string $$$a_l,a_{l+1},\\ldots,a_r$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$, $$$q$$$ ($$$1\\le n,q\\le 5\\cdot10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a string $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next $$$q$$$ lines contain the description of queries. The $$$i$$$-th line contains two integers $$$l_i$$$, $$$r_i$$$ ($$$1\\le l_i\\le r_i\\le n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On the $$$i$$$-th line, output the answer to the $$$i$$$-th query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n12 6\naaaabbbbaaaa\n1 12\n2 7\n3 10\n4 7\n5 9\n4 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n2\n3\n2\n3\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first query, the following palindrome strings occur at least twice: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a,aa,aaa,aaaa,b,bb,bbb"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". The longest one is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aaaa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", so the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"humor value"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is $$$4$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second query, one of the longest "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"humor"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" strings with respect to $$$s[2, 7]$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"H","problemCode":"2164H","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2164/problem/H"}